description: |
  Creates a new issue in a Jira project (Cloud or Server). You can use this command to open incidents, tasks, or sub-tasks directly in Jira as part of an automated workflow or manual response. It supports both basic field-based input (like summary, project, and issue type) and advanced use through a full issue_json object for maximum flexibility. The command allows setting properties such as assignee, reporter, priority, due date, environment, components, and labels. Compatible with Jira Cloud and Jira Server. Fields and behavior may vary slightly between platforms.
